      "kind": "text",
      "line": 16,
      "zh": "十二幕可学习弹幕、擦弹充能与双槽星械。闪现穿幕，满能量释放彗核冲击。",
      "en": "Twelve acts to learn bullet patterns, graze charging and dual star devices. Blink through curtains and release a Comet Core Burst at full energy."
