    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 21,
      "zh": "擦过弹幕外缘会积攒彗能；满能量释放冲击可清弹并重创核心。相位闪现沿当前移动方向穿越危险区。",
      "en": "Grazing the outer edge of bullets builds comet energy; at full energy, release a burst to clear bullets and badly damage the core. Phase Blink passes through danger zones in your current movement direction."
    },
