      "kind": "text",
      "line": 27,
      "zh": "WASD / 方向键或拖动画面移动；Space 闪现，Q 释放彗核冲击。",
      "en": "Move with WASD / arrow keys or by dragging the screen; Space to blink, Q to release Comet Core Burst."
