    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 38,
      "zh": "第一章 · 近星层",
      "en": "Chapter 1 · Near-Star Layer"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 38,
      "zh": "环雨初航",
      "en": "Ring Rain Maiden Voyage"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 38,
      "zh": "规律圆环从核心向外扩散，寻找环与环之间的呼吸间隙。",
      "en": "Regular rings spread out from the core; look for the breathing gaps between rings."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 39,
      "zh": "扇面追光",
      "en": "Fan Light Chase"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 39,
      "zh": "扇形弹幕锁定发射瞬间的位置，持续侧移比慌乱折返更安全。",
      "en": "Fan barrages lock onto your position at the moment of firing; sustained sidestepping is safer than panicked reversals."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 40,
      "zh": "裂隙车道",
      "en": "Rift Lanes"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 40,
      "zh": "平行弹墙留下会移动的缺口，预判下一条安全车道。",
      "en": "Parallel bullet walls leave moving gaps; predict the next safe lane."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 41,
      "zh": "双旋风眼",
      "en": "Twin Cyclone Eye"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 41,
      "zh": "顺逆两股螺旋交替出现，贴近弹流内缘可以快速充能。",
      "en": "Clockwise and counterclockwise spirals alternate; hugging the inner edge of the stream charges quickly."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 42,
      "zh": "第二章 · 彗尾带",
      "en": "Chapter 2 · Comet Tail Belt"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 42,
      "zh": "折返彗片",
      "en": "Boomerang Shards"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 42,
      "zh": "彗片越过左界后会折返一次，不要把退路留在身后。",
      "en": "Shards turn back once after crossing the left border; do not leave your retreat behind you."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 43,
      "zh": "引力花冠",
      "en": "Gravity Corona"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 43,
      "zh": "花瓣弹会缓慢弯向你，短促换向比长距离逃离更有效。",
      "en": "Petal bullets slowly curve toward you; short direction changes beat long escapes."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 44,
      "zh": "交叉星桥",
      "en": "Cross Star Bridge"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 44,
      "zh": "横纵弹列同时切割战场，用闪现跨越交叉封锁。",
      "en": "Horizontal and vertical bullet rows cut the field at once; use blink to cross the intersecting blockade."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 45,
      "zh": "镜像猎手",
      "en": "Mirror Hunters"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 45,
      "zh": "两枚追踪核心从上下夹击，先诱导再穿过中线。",
      "en": "Two homing cores pincer from above and below; lure them first, then cross the center line."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 46,
      "zh": "第三章 · 星幕心",
      "en": "Chapter 3 · Star Curtain Heart"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 46,
      "zh": "脉冲王冠",
      "en": "Pulse Crown"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 46,
      "zh": "快慢圆环交错形成假缺口，观察颜色分辨速度。",
      "en": "Fast and slow rings interleave to form false gaps; read the colors to tell the speed."
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 47,
      "zh": "坠星瀑布",
      "en": "Falling Star Cascade"
    },
    {
      "file": "comet-weaver.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 47,
      "zh": "上方弹雨与核心扇面叠加，横向移动必须保留回转空间。",
      "en": "Bullet rain from above stacks with the core fans; keep room to turn around when moving sideways."
